      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "- So what's your name?<br>- Napol\xE9on.<br>- Ahaha, finally a quality.
    It's a beautiful name.<br>- Hm.<br>The pirate was not very talkative, it must
    be said that he felt overwhelmed by the invasive charisma of this fish like no
    other. Said person now walked proudly while humming a joyful tune. She had beaten
    him by far during their altercation and now she wanted to get into his boat.
    She had managed to manipulate him without him even suspecting it. This woman
    was really impressive."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e51d75028f0b5bc45a663410f3b1257d, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 559331918830543118, guid: e51d75028f0b5bc45a663410f3b1257d, type: 2}
